<h2>Aside 1.8.1 for testers</h2>
<h3>Clearer free tester licenses</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Free tester licenses show their expiry without subscription or automatic-renewal wording.</li>
  <li>When a free license ends, Aside explains how to get an extension from the beta administrator.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Getting access</h3>
<p>Activate your existing license, then request beta access in Settings &gt; License.</p>
